{"seq":2,"slug":"refund-retry-schedule","title":"重试节奏与渠道窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/refund-intelligent-routing/refund-retry-engine/refund-retry-schedule","wordCount":2167,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"重试节奏与渠道窗口\">重试节奏与渠道窗口</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>判定为可重试之后，下一个问题不是「重试不重试」而是「什么时候重试」。这个时机选择受两个方向的力拉扯：重试太频繁会在渠道已经很忙时雪上加霜，触发限流甚至风控，把小问题放大成渠道级故障；重试太稀疏则让退款到账时间被无谓拉长，用户在等待中投诉。退避策略要在这两端之间找到平衡，同时还要与渠道自身的<strong>时间窗口</strong>对齐——很多渠道不是随时受理退款的。</p>\n<p>渠道窗口是这个主题里最容易被忽略、又最影响成败的因素。卡组织的批处理不是实时的：退款的最终清算往往在渠道的日切点批量提交，某些渠道只在特定时段受理退款请求，跨境渠道还要叠加时区与当地工作日。一笔在当前时刻「失败」的退款，可能只是因为批处理窗口还没到，等到下一个窗口自然会成功。把重试安排在窗口开启之后，比盲目退避能显著提高单次成功率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;判定 RETRYABLE&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;是否在渠道受理窗口内?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[&quot;调度到下一个窗口开启时刻&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D[&quot;计算退避延迟&lt;br/&gt;指数 + 抖动&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;距首次发起是否超过总时限?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[&quot;升级为 TERMINAL_SWITCH&lt;br/&gt;进入换道&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[&quot;入队等待到期&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;到期后重试&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[\"判定 RETRYABLE\"] --&gt; B{\"是否在渠道受理窗口内?\"}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[\"调度到下一个窗口开启时刻\"]\n    B --&gt;|是| D[\"计算退避延迟&lt;br/&gt;指数 + 抖动\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"距首次发起是否超过总时限?\"}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[\"升级为 TERMINAL_SWITCH&lt;br/&gt;进入换道\"]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[\"入队等待到期\"]\n    C --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[\"到期后重试\"]\n    H --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"退避算法-指数加抖动\">退避算法：指数加抖动</h2><p>基础的重试节奏是<strong>指数退避</strong>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = d_0 \\cdot 2^{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，例如从 30 秒开始依次为 30 秒、1 分钟、2 分钟、4 分钟、8 分钟。指数增长的目的是给下游足够的恢复时间，避免在故障期间持续冲击。</p>\n<p>纯指数退避有一个著名的缺陷：大量同时开始的退款会在同一时刻重试，形成周期性的脉冲，反而在每次退避到期时制造一次小高峰。解法是叠加<strong>抖动（jitter）</strong>。常见的抖动形式有三种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抖动形式</th>\n<th>延迟公式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = d_0 \\cdot 2^{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>同步脉冲，不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>random</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = \\text{random}(0, d_0 \\cdot 2^{n-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">random</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>打散最彻底，但可能很短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>random</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = d_0 \\cdot 2^{n-1} / 2 + \\text{random}(0, d_0 \\cdot 2^{n-1}/2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">random</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>兼顾下界与打散，常用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>等抖动在业界最常用，因为它保证延迟不低于指数退避的一半，同时把重试时刻随机化到同量级的一个区间内，足以打散脉冲。</p>\n<p>退避参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与最大延迟应按渠道配置。对响应快的本地渠道，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可以小到 30 秒；对跨境渠道或已经处于降级状态的渠道，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应显著放大。参数属于配置的范畴，且与 <a href=\"refund-fail-classify-retry\">退款失败分类与可重试判定</a> 里提到的「渠道健康度」联动：健康度下降时自动放大退避，而不是让每笔退款各自按固定参数重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与渠道窗口和批处理对齐\">与渠道窗口和批处理对齐</h2><p>退避给出的是「最早什么时刻可以重试」，渠道窗口给出的是「什么时刻重试才有意义」，两者取较晚者。</p>\n<p>需要建模的窗口有几类。<strong>受理时段窗口</strong>：某些渠道只在当地工作日的特定时段接受退款请求，非受理时段的请求会被直接拒绝，这类拒绝其实不该算作失败。<strong>批处理时点</strong>：退款的最终状态在批处理后才确定，因此重试的间隔至少要覆盖一个批处理周期，否则会在同一批处理周期内反复提交。<strong>日切窗口</strong>：渠道在日切期间可能短暂停止服务，重试应避开这个区间。<strong>原交易引用窗口</strong>：这是最长的一个窗口，超过它原交易不可冲正，因此它是重试总时限的天然上界之一。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;adyen_card&quot;,&#10;  &quot;accept_window&quot;: { &quot;days&quot;: [&quot;Mon&quot;, &quot;Tue&quot;, &quot;Wed&quot;, &quot;Thu&quot;, &quot;Fri&quot;], &quot;hours_local&quot;: [8, 20], &quot;tz&quot;: &quot;Europe/Amsterdam&quot; },&#10;  &quot;batch_cutoff_local&quot;: &quot;17:30&quot;,&#10;  &quot;retry&quot;: { &quot;base_seconds&quot;: 60, &quot;max_seconds&quot;: 3600, &quot;max_attempts&quot;: 8, &quot;total_deadline_hours&quot;: 72, &quot;jitter&quot;: &quot;equal&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"adyen_card\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"accept_window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Mon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Tue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Wed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Thu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Fri\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hours_local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Europe/Amsterdam\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"batch_cutoff_local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"17:30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"retry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"base_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_attempts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"total_deadline_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">72</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"jitter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"equal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张配置表把「何时能重试」与「何时值得重试」都表达了出来，执行器按它计算下一次尝试时刻。配置的每一项都有明确的失败语义：<code>accept_window</code> 之外的重试应被调度而非立即执行；<code>max_attempts</code> 与 <code>total_deadline_hours</code> 共同构成放弃条件，谁先到算谁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"总时限与升级为换道\">总时限与升级为换道</h2><p>重试不能无限进行。两个终止条件必须同时存在：<strong>尝试次数上限</strong>与<strong>总时长上限</strong>。只设次数上限是不够的，因为一笔退款的尝试次数可能很少但间隔很长；只设时长上限也不够，因为某些渠道的错误会导致快速失败，次数会在短时间内耗尽。</p>\n<p>总时限的设定要与原路失效的判定对齐。第二章讲原交易引用窗口是「永久失效」的一种，那条时间线同样约束重试：如果重试总时限已经逼近原交易引用窗口的尽头，那么继续重试的风险是「试到窗口关闭也没成功，白等一场」。因此重试引擎应当在接近该窗口时<strong>提前</strong>升级为换道，而不是等到窗口关闭才判定永久失效。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>终止条件</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>后续动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>尝试次数达上限</td>\n<td>第 N 次仍失败</td>\n<td>升级为 TERMINAL_SWITCH，进入换道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总时长超上限</td>\n<td>距首次发起超过 T</td>\n<td>升级为 TERMINAL_SWITCH，进入换道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果变为成功</td>\n<td>任一尝试成功</td>\n<td>关闭退款单及其余尝试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果变为永久失效</td>\n<td>映射升级</td>\n<td>立即进入换道，不再等待</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>升级为换道时，重试引擎要把「已经试过哪些路径、各自失败于什么」作为证据交给换道决策，而不是让换道从零开始。这一点与第二章换道执行器的候选序列设计相呼应——重试的历史是判断「哪条路更可能成功」的重要输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试节奏的可观测与调优\">重试节奏的可观测与调优</h2><p>退避参数不是一次设对就永远正确的，它需要被数据驱动地调优。三个核心指标：</p>\n<p><strong>成功率随尝试次数的分布</strong>。第几次重试带来了最大比例的成功，能回答「重试几次是值得的」。如果绝大多数成功都发生在第一次重试，那么后续的激进重试价值有限；如果第 5 次重试仍有可观的成功率，说明渠道确实存在较长的恢复时间。</p>\n<p><strong>失败原因随尝试次数的迁移</strong>。同一个退款在多次尝试间失败原因如何变化。若原因从「限流」逐渐变成「原交易不存在」，说明重试正在把暂时失败耗成永久失败，此时应提前换道而非继续重试。</p>\n<p><strong>延迟成本</strong>。每多一次重试平均推迟到账多久，与用户投诉的相关性。这是决定总时限的输入。</p>\n<p>调优的动作是修改配置并观察指标，而不是改代码。这条纪律保证了调优本身可回滚、可审计，且能按渠道、按市场差异化进行——不同渠道的最优退避参数差异很大，用一个全局参数覆盖所有渠道必然次优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重试节奏由<strong>退避算法</strong>与<strong>渠道窗口</strong>共同决定：前者保证给下游恢复时间，后者界定「何时重试才有意义」，执行时取两者较晚的时刻。</li>\n<li>退避用指数增长叠加<strong>抖动</strong>打散同步脉冲，等抖动（下界为指数值一半，区间内随机）在业界最常用。</li>\n<li>需要建模的渠道窗口有四类：受理时段窗口、批处理时点、日切窗口、原交易引用窗口；非受理时段的拒绝其实不该算作失败。</li>\n<li>退避参数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、最大延迟、尝试上限、总时限）应按渠道配置，并与渠道健康度联动——健康度下降时自动放大退避，而非让每笔各自按固定参数冲击。</li>\n<li>重试必须以<strong>尝试次数上限与总时长上限双重终止条件</strong>收敛，谁先到算谁；并在接近原交易引用窗口时<strong>提前</strong>升级为换道，避免白等到窗口关闭。</li>\n<li>升级换道时要把「已试过哪些路径、各自失败于什么」作为证据交给换道决策，而不是让换道从零开始。</li>\n<li>退避参数应由「成功率随尝试次数的分布」「失败原因随尝试次数的迁移」「延迟成本」三个指标驱动调优，调优动作是改配置而非改代码。</li>\n<li>重试的全部前提是它不会造成重复出款，这是 <a href=\"refund-idempotency-route\">退款重试幂等防重复退</a> 的主题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重试节奏与渠道窗口","id":"重试节奏与渠道窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"退避算法：指数加抖动","id":"退避算法-指数加抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"与渠道窗口和批处理对齐","id":"与渠道窗口和批处理对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"总时限与升级为换道","id":"总时限与升级为换道"},{"level":2,"text":"重试节奏的可观测与调优","id":"重试节奏的可观测与调优"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"退款失败分类与可重试判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/refund-intelligent-routing/refund-retry-engine/refund-fail-classify-retry"},"next":{"title":"退款重试幂等防重复退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/refund-intelligent-routing/refund-retry-engine/refund-idempotency-route"}}